This is a very large and complex app to build. Let me plan my approach carefully before starting.

## Architecture Plan

### Files to create:

**Backend endpoints:**
1. `src/api/getRecords.ts` - Fetch all Database rows (paginated batches)
2. `src/api/updateRecord.ts` - Update a Database row
3. `src/api/getUploads.ts` - Fetch all Uploads rows
4. `src/api/createUpload.ts` - Create a new Upload row

**Config:**
5. `src/config/roles.ts` - Email arrays for role assignment

**Utility/shared:**
6. `src/lib/calculations.ts` - All virtual field calculations (Item Price, Item Cost, Profit, AED conversion, Shipping Fee, etc.)
7. `src/lib/formatters.ts` - Date formatting, currency formatting
8. `src/types/index.ts` - Shared TypeScript types

**Components:**
9. `src/components/AppShell.tsx` - Global shell with auth, role check, navigation
10. `src/components/GlobalSearch.tsx` - Search bar
11. `src/components/UploadMasterlistFAB.tsx` - Floating action button for uploads
12. `src/components/ClientProfileCard.tsx` - Expandable client card (shared across tabs)
13. `src/components/InvoiceView.tsx` - Printable invoice component
14. `src/components/PulloutReport.tsx` - Printable pullout report

**Tab components:**
15. `src/components/tabs/AdminPipeline.tsx` - Tab 1
16. `src/components/tabs/DispatchBoard.tsx` - Tab 2
17. `src/components/tabs/AccountsTracking.tsx` - Tab 3
18. `src/components/tabs/BossingDashboard.tsx` - Tab 4

**Sub-components for each tab:**
- Admin: inline edit fields, status dropdown, SLA badge, freeSf toggle
- Dispatch: shipping fee display, status change, pullout report button
- Accounts: financials form, layaway inputs, remittance dropdown
