// Google Sheets SDK v1.0.0
// Defines the typescript classes/functions to interact with the sheets in this spreadsheet.

// The SDK class and field names are stable identifiers that don't change when renamed. Each sheet and column has a comment with its current user-facing name in quotes (e.g., // "Task Name").
// Important: The quoted name reflects the most up-to-date name and meaning of the column.
// If the SDK name differs from the quoted name, it means the column was renamed. The quoted name is the source of truth for the meaning of the column.
